    m_LineSpacing: 1
  m_Text: 'Welcome to Mission Creek, in the Santa Ynez Mountains: an area prone to
    wildfires, which also contributes water to Southern California. Based on a model
    incorporating the current scientific understanding of how landscapes work, this
    interactive simulation of a real watershed illustrates the effects of climatic
    changes on snow, stream, soil, vegetation and fire. Future Mountain allows users
    to explore different perspectives in time, space and climate temperature.'
